<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT GREECE 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT GREECE 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark beat Greece 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a World Cup European group one qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Denmark - Theodoros Zagorakis (25th min, own goal),</p>
<p>Brian Laudrup (50th)</p>
<p>Greece - Georgios Donis (35th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,226</p>
<p>Group one standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Greece		 3   2   0   1   6   2    6</p>
<p> Denmark		2   2   0   0   4   1    6</p>
<p> Croatia		1   1   0   0   4   1    3</p>
<p> Slovenia	     2   0   0   2   0   4    0</p>
<p> Bosnia		 2   0   0   2   1   7    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 9 Slovenia v Bosnia, Nov 10 Croatia v</p>
<p>Greece</p>
</text>
